bject","since":"3.0","description":"A configuration object for the button theme. The object accepts SVG properties like <code>stroke-width</code>, <code>stroke</code> and <code>fill</code>. Tri-state button styles are supported by the <code>states.hover</code> and <code>states.select</code> objects.","demo":"<a href=\"http://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/highcharts/navigation/buttonoptions-theme/\" target=\"_blank\">Theming the buttons</a>","deprecated":false,"fullname":"navigation.buttonOptions.theme","title":"theme","parent":"navigation-buttonOptions","isParent":false,"products":[],"defaults":"","values":"","seeAlso":""},{"name":"chart-resetZoomButton--theme","returnType":"Object","since":"2.2","description":"A collection of attributes for the button. The object takes SVG attributes like  <code>fill</code>, <code>stroke</code>, <code>stroke-width</code> or <code>r</code>, the border radius. The theme also supports <code>style</code>, a collection of CSS properties for the text. Equivalent attributes for the hover state are given in <code>theme.states.hover</code>.","demo":"<a href=\"http://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/highcharts/chart/resetzoombutton-theme/\" target=\"_blank\">Theming the button</a>","fullname":"chart.resetZoomButton.theme","title":"theme","parent":"chart-resetZoomButton","isParent":false,"products":[]},{"name":"exporting-buttons-contextButton--theme","returnType":"Object","since":"3.0","description":"A configuration object for the button theme. The object accepts SVG properties like <code>stroke-width</code>, <code>stroke</code> and <code>fill</code>. Tri-state button styles are supported by the <code>states.hover</code> and <code>states.select</code> objects.","demo":"<a href=\"http://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/highcharts/navigation/buttonoptions-theme/\" target=\"_blank\">Theming the buttons</a>","deprecated